{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛•回家之三代同糖》成員車婉婉、樊亦敏、李茵彤，今天（2日）再有新成員加入，有份演《開心速遞》的沈可欣回歸，由上輯「Rebecca」變為新角色「香菇」，羅毓儀（Yuki）會擔當長駐角色「招積琪」，而穎喬和甄敏芳則客串演出，眾女演員換上女僕服示人，配合劇情推進。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:08.815068+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:50:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:18:53.054056+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:11.530327+00:00","content_hash":"76f08fe8706412fe4fe328a97123f3e605f2bf8ed64a94dae489c05eff45ab59","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}